# K05 v7, Pace (queue-nov3b p3): the Command look's key and laser, but Pace keeps its own coat band (PACE_DEFAULTS face
# 6: v7's Command band blew out on the black 12K) and plate lift (amb 1.35: with 0.20 the frame failed the fill rule,
# lit 6 %, out/k05v7/d_v7_pace).
--wp_z 0.30
--wp_x 0.70
--wp_y 0.40
--wp_deg 16
--wpool 260
--wfill 3
--rim 14
--glow 2.4
--laser 26
# v7c (REQUEST K05-command-fix items 3-6 apply to Pace too, same laser rig): the laser breaks at every hole, no widest
# halo scale, no profile wake, no stone patch in the holes (the bore walls' crescents draw the holes; out/k05b/fix_p).
# The face, its lacquer band and Pace's lights are unchanged.
--hole_break 1
--nprof 0
--glow_wide 0
--holefloor 0
